      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹56.01 (vs ₹8.29 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹56.01 (up from ₹8.29 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.42b (up 35% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹100.8m (up ₹85.9m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.1% (up from 1.4% in FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 91% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 2% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
